    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Four eras. One destiny.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Zenogaias</i> is a sweeping, turn-based JRPG that spans the ages \u2014 from 8-bit Fantasy to HD Sci-Fi\u2014 across four full-length Episodes, each inspired by a different era of gaming's greatest JRPGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linked together by a powerful, epic narrative, each Episode evolves in tone, visuals, mechanics, and music to reflect the growth of the genre itself while exploring themes of fate, identity, and the unbreakable bonds forged across generations. <br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852790/extras/a49b9e297b44f4f60d0fbc8422ca291a.avif?t=1754925095\" alt=\"Box art for Zenogaias Episode I Alpha and Omega modeled after NES carts.\" width=258 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852790/extras/13c109ec6573ac21a276e218e239ab1b.poster.avif?t=1754925095\" width=566 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852790/extras/13c109ec6573ac21a276e218e239ab1b.webm?t=1754925095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852790/extras/13c109ec6573ac21a276e218e239ab1b.mp4?t=1754925095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>EPISODE I \u2014 <i>Alpha and Omega</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(8-bit | Fantasy)</strong><br>A mysterious plague sweeps the land, turning the afflicted into monsters. Dame Alyria, a battle-hardened knight and grieving mother, is tasked with uncovering its source before humanity becomes extinct. Journey across a land of danger and secrets in a tale that echoes the classic roots of the JRPG genre.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852790/extras/ee129b58ecc913a9ea055bcf296f8e9b.avif?t=1754925095\" alt=\"Box art for Zenogaias Episode II The Watcher &amp;amp; The Deliverer modeled after SNES carts.\" width=435 height=375 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852790/extras/b5102649d1fbf416b189577284ec9ac2.poster.avif?t=1754925095\" width=556 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852790/extras/b5102649d1fbf416b189577284ec9ac2.webm?t=1754925095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852790/extras/b5102649d1fbf416b189577284ec9ac2.mp4?t=1754925095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPISODE II \u2014 <i>The Watcher &amp; The Deliverer</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(16-bit | Fantasy)</strong><br>Dame Captain Rei leads an elite airship squadron during a time of political upheaval. Betrayed during the mission and stranded in enemy territory, she uncovers a truth that challenges everything she had ever known. Unravel a growing conspiracy across the snowy northern regions in this war story where all is not as it seems.<br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852790/extras/40f6118bd1870918942cfddd2b66efc8.avif?t=1754925095\" alt=\"Box art for Zenogaias Episode III The Beginning and The End reminiscent of PSX-style CD carts.\" width=392 height=350 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852790/extras/2a33eedbc4fd2261bbe456e9da08598c.poster.avif?t=1754925095\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852790/extras/2a33eedbc4fd2261bbe456e9da08598c.webm?t=1754925095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPISODE III \u2014 <i>The Beginning and the End</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(PSX-inspired | Sci-Fi)</strong><br>In the far future, a galactic war looms over the discovery of a powerful energy source \u2014 the Razael Particle. Captain Hector and his crew find themselves entangled in a battle for the fate of the universe itself, where rivalries, identities, and ideals collide. Cosmic-scale drama meets personal sacrifice in a collision that sets the stage for a revelation that will echo across worlds and generations.<br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852790/extras/dcaa35fa51570b926211cf4b02e98923.avif?t=1754925095\" alt=\"Box art for Zenogaias Episode IV Legacy modeled to appear akin to modern-day HD game carts.\" width=425 height=332 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852790/extras/2cc3325a5a12f79b72f3a06892620ac2.poster.avif?t=1754925095\" width=616 height=353 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852790/extras/2cc3325a5a12f79b72f3a06892620ac2.webm?t=1754925095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPISODE IV \u2014 <i>Legacy</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(HD | Fantasy/Sci-Fi Fusion)</strong> <br>A Wandering Witch and an Elemental Slayer embark on a quest to prevent an apocalypse that threatens the very fabric of the world itself.\u00a0<i>Legacy</i> brings the saga full circle \u2014 challenging you to reckon with the past, shape the future, and decide what your legacy will be.<br><br><br><strong>FEATURING:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro-evolutionary presentation: from 8-bit  to HD  JRPG visuals, music, and styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four distinct Episodes \u2014 each a full-length game in its own right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the Episodes in any order you like via the Episode Selection Menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat with era-specific mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four difficulty settings that can be chosen anytime: Easy, Normal, Hard, Nightmare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotionally rich storytelling across multiple protagonists and timelines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter bar on all Overworld maps/earlier Episode dungeons giving the player warning about &quot;random&quot; encounters. Later Episodes feature visible enemies for dungeon-type areas.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save anywhere outside of cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring the vocal talents of\u00a0<strong>Carolina Padr\u00f3n</strong> and numerous indie composers and artists for a grand soundtrack encapsulating each era<br><br><br><strong>Whether a lifelong fan of JRPGs or new to the genre, <i>Zenogaias</i> is both a loving tribute to the classics that came before, and a transformative saga that carries the weight of generations\u2014a story of memory, legacy, and how they have shaped the future.</strong></p></li></ul>",
