full circle \u2014 challenging you to reckon with the past, shape the future, and decide what your legacy will be.<br><br><br><strong>FEATURING:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro-evolutionary presentation: from 8-bit  to HD  JRPG visuals, music, and styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four distinct Episodes \u2014 each a full-length game in its own right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the Episodes in any order you like via the Episode Selection Menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat with era-specific mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four difficulty settings that can be chosen anytime: Easy, Normal, Hard, Nightmare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotionally rich storytelling across multiple protagonists and timelines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter bar on all Overworld maps/earlier Episode dungeons giving the player warning about &quot;random&quot; encounters. Later Episodes feature visible enemies for dungeon-type areas.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save anywhere outside of cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring the vocal talents of\u00a0<strong>Carolina Padr\u00f3n</strong> and numerous indie composers and artists for a grand soundtrack encapsulating each era<br><br><br><strong>Whether a lifelong fan of JRPGs or new to the genre, <i>Zenogaias</i> is both a loving tribute to the classics that came before, and a transformative saga that carries the weight of generations\u2014a story of memory, legacy, and how they have shaped the future.</strong></p></li></ul>",
